in the fun&nbsp;June 17-20, 2025 for the&nbsp;Best Show in Snow in&nbsp;Grand Rapids, MI.&nbsp;<a href="https://show.sima.org/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1464_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1465_ pf-heading-7-h3"><font color="#be1e2d">Live, Online Auction — May 15</font></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1467_ pf-heading-1-h3">Thursday, May 15, 2025</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1469_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Preview Day: 5/14. Preview Location: Russo Elgin - 1001 N Randall Rd, Elgin, IL 60123. <a href="/pages/online-used-equipment-auctions" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1471_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1472_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Live, In-Person Auction — April 5</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1474_ pf-heading-1-h3">Auction begins at 8:00am at Russo: Hainesville | Preview Day: 4/4, Hainesville</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1476_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Plan to spend the day bidding on an assortment of high-quality used equipment. If you haven't registered for your bid card yet, get there early so you can do that before the first bid at 8:30 AM! <strong><a href="/pages/spring-used-equipment-auction" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1478_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1479_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ECHO’s Commercial Maintenance Seminar — March 21, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI