lank">Learn More &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1564_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1565_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference — January&nbsp;23 - 24, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1567_ pf-heading-1-h3">Hyatt Regency – Chicago, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1569_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference holds the unique distinction of being the largest state park and recreation conference in the nation. The conference brings together thousands of professionals, Commissioners, and elected officials from around the state for three exciting days of quality educational programming, networking, and professional development. Visit Russo at Booth #234.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b><a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1571_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1572_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Lawn Care Application Timing — January&nbsp;15, 2025</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1574_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI — 11:00AM Social &amp; Lunch, 1:00PM Seminar Starts</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1576_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>Have questions about applying plant health care products like fertilizers, chemicals, or seed?&nbsp;</strong>Join us for this engaging seminar with Larry Vogel (Spring Valley), Patrick Bastron (PBI Gordon), and Rob Osier (Russo Plant&nbsp;Health Care Manager). They'll address common concerns and share practical tips to boost your confidence and maximize effectiveness in lawn care applications. Whether you're a seasoned pro or just starting out, this event is the perfect opportunity to gain valuable insights. Plus, enjoy a free lunch!&nbsp;<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lawn-care-application-timing-tickets-1132721403209?aff=eventcal" target="_self"><strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lawn-care-application-timing-tickets-1132721403209?aff=eventcal" target="_blank">RSVP today &gt;</a></strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1578_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1579_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILA Holiday Party&nbsp; — Dec 12, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1581_ pf-heading-1-h3">Liter House – Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1583_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join in for a fun night at the ILA's Annual Meeting / Holiday Party featuring Live Music, Guest Comedian, and Raffle Prizes.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://ila.wildapricot.org/event-5927885" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1585_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1586_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">WNLA Holiday Party&nbsp; — Dec&nbsp;4, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1588_ pf-heading-1-h3">The Wisconsin Club – Milwaukee, WI</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1590_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join in&nbsp;for a fun evening of networking, celebrating award winners, dinner and drinks!&nbsp;<a href="https://wnla.net/meetinginfo.php?id=60&amp;ts=1728404774" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs