ce Seminar — Indiana — Nov 14, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1611_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: Fort Wayne, IN — 10:00AM - 11:30AM EST</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1613_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"></a>Learn about the best chainsaw safety practices from Taylor McKenney, a Field Application Specialist with STIHL Bryan Equipment. He will cover and discuss all the basics from safe chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more. Lunch will be provided for those who attend!&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-maintenance-seminar-tickets-1038105189567?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve Your Spot &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1615_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1616_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA The Impact Conference&nbsp; — Oct 24, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1618_ pf-heading-1-h3">Northern Illinois University – Naperville, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1620_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Attend invigorating sessions on sustainable and ecological landscape practices. Plus&nbsp;networking opportunities with those new to sustainable practice and old pros who know the ropes. <a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/impact-conference/" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1622_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1623_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Echo One-Day-Only Sale — Oct 11, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1625_ pf-heading-1-h3">All Russo and Powered by Russo&nbsp;Locations</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1627_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">15% off MSRP on select in-stock models on 10/11/24 only! Valid at ALL Russo Locations, Porters, and Haltom<strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-984191522337?aff=eventcal" target="_self"></a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1629_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1630_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Engine Maintenance Seminar — Wisconsin&nbsp;— Oct 11, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1632_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI — 10:00AM - NOON</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1634_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"></a>Ensure the equipment you depend on is well taken care of by keeping the engine in prime condition. Learn about general engine maintenance, end-of-season storage &amp; winter maintenance, plus engine re-powers from Shields Bergstrom, a Customer Education Specialist with Briggs &amp; Stratton.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/engine-maintenance-seminar-tickets-1038668073167?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve Your Spot &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1636_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1637_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Chainsaw Safety &amp; Maintenance CEU Seminar — Oct 4, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1639_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: Elgin, IL — 10:00AM CDT</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1641_ pf-text-2" d