4.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1829_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1830_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IGE Indiana Green Expo&nbsp;— January&nbsp;18 - 19, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1832_ pf-heading-1-h3">Indiana Convention Center in Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1834_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Indiana Green Expo 2024 two-day Trade Show provides opportunities for turf and landscape professionals to meet with vendors and view the newest products and technology. Plan to be a part of it! Visit Russo at Booth #118 &amp; Haltom at Booth #123.&nbsp;<a href="https://indianagreenexpo.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-1836_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1837_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA&nbsp;InVigorateU Conference&nbsp;— January&nbsp;16 - 17, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-1839_ pf-heading-1-h3">DoubleTree by Hilton in Bloomington, IL</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-1841_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">InVigorateU is an annual education conference that not only offers great sessions and CEUs, but also offers a chance to reflect on what worked this season and collaborate with peers about what you might want to do differently in the next to get stronger results. Visit Russo at&nbsp;Booth #22.&nbsp;<a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/invigorateu/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class=