ce— August 10</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2189_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Earn 3 CEUs while learning strategies to diversify your business and keep plants happy &amp; healthy! Sponsored by ArborJet &amp; Ecologel.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2191_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2195_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>ILCA Fire &amp; Ice Summer Field &amp; Snow Day— August 4</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2197_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Cantigny Park in Wheaton, IL<br></b><br>We’re going to be one of over 100 exhibitors at ILCA’s brand-new Fire &amp; Ice summer field and snow day, and we can’t wait to see you! <a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/fire-and-ice/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2199_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2203_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>IAA Tree Climbing Championship — June 25</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2205_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Shiloh Park in Zion, IL<br><br>7am - Competitor gear check
8:15am - Competition preliminary events begin</b><br><br>We’re heading to the IAA Tree Climbing Championship for a day full of competition, fun, and outdoor activities. Our certified arborist, Dan, will be judging the competition and we'll have a booth at the fair. Stop by to learn more about all things arbor! <a href="https://illinoisarborist.org/2022-illinois-tree-climbing-championship/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2207_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2211_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live Online Auction — June 15</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2213_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Elgin </b>- 1001 N Randall Rd, Elgin, IL 60123, USA<b><br><br>Consign By:</b> 5/21   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 6/14</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2215_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2219_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Chainsaw Safety Seminar — June 10</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2221_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Hainesville </b>- 39 East Belvidere Road, Hainesville, IL 60030, USA<br><br>Earn 1.5 ISA CEUs while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from a certified chainsaw technician. We’ll cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2223_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2227_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>APWA Chicago Expo &amp; Roadeo — May 18 &amp; 19</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2229_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Odeum Expo Center in Villa Park, IL</b><br><br>While attending the APWA Expo, stop by our booth, say hi, and we’ll fill you in on all of the exciting news and equipment we have in stock! <a href="http://chicago.apwa.net/Content/Chapters/chicago.apwa.net/Documents/2022%20APWA%20CMC%20Expo%20Exhibitor%20Sponsor%20Information(3).pdf" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2231_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2235_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;In-Person Auction — April 9</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2237_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Auction begins at 8:00am at Russo:</b> Hainesville   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 04/08, Hainesville<br><br>After a long break due to Covid, we're excited to announce the return of our in-person auction! Plan to spend the day bidding on an assortment of high-quality used equipment.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2239_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2243_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Russo Spring Open House</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2245_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We’re happy to announce the long-awaited return of the Russo Open House! Spring Open House features representatives from the most prominent companies in the industry putting on demonstrations and informing customers of the newest products on the market. Save the date for a day full of fun, raffles, giveaways, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2247_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2251_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — March 16</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2253_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>No Consignment   |   Preview Day:</b> 03/15, Elgin</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-dGCntx oZLzg pf-2255_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-2259_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Service Hiring Event at Schiller Park — March 10 &amp; 11</b></h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-2261_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>In-person Interviews &amp; On-the-spot Offers<br></b><br>Meet the staff, see the space, have some food, and have an in-person interview with potential offers! We're hiring multiple people for 3 positions: Service Porters, Service Mechanics, &amp; Lead Service Advisor. All mechanic levels from apprentice to master are welcome to apply! Visit <a href="/pages/careers" target="_self">RussoPower.com/careers</a>&nbsp;7 to see all job opportunities!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
